Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.01,0:20:45.86,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}我把你从坟墓中偷走
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:48.52,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}So cursed to be a slave
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:48.52,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}永远无法摆脱世代为奴的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:54.18,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}There's a darkness I keep that you can never see beyond
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.52,0:20:54.18,song,,0,0,0,,{\blur1}我留下一片无尽的黑暗 而你永远无法一眼看透
