Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:38.66,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}So, are the days no sweeter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:41.50,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}I got 'em on their knees
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.55,0:01:44.51,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Rotten to the core deeper, I couldn't hate them more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:48.74,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}I have reawakened for revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.79,0:01:52.64,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}All these petty rules won't stop me now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:54.49,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}They chew up and spit you out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:56.30,op en,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur1}Statue will leave a body count
